{
    "title": "Morph&Mob Mod for MinecraftPE",
    "description": "Morph&Mob Mod for MinecraftPE is an application that includes the different mods and maps for the game Minecraft PE.\r\nDo you love to play minecraft? Want a completely new feel? If you want to feel the whole spirit of Minecraft PE and immerse yourself in the atmosphere of adventure, then these mods and maps are especially for you! \r\n\r\nIn the application you will find mods:\r\n\u201cTrue Zombie Survival\u201d - Could you withstand a world where hordes of zombies have taken over everything? Scavenge abandoned buildings for food, meds, and ammunition. Your gun is your best and most trustworthy friend. Be prepared to clutch in a fight with dozens of new types of zombies. Some have simply become faster, and some can explode like creepers!!!\r\n\u201cVampire Craft\u201d - Become a powerful vampire, a nocturnal creature thirsty for blood in Minecraft PE. But beware, not everyone is happy about the whole vampire situation, and they go for a hunt. Use your supernatural powers to fight the vampire hunters and become a ruler of the Minecraft world.\r\n\u201cMorph into mobs\u201d - This mod allows you to turn yourself almost into every mob in the game just in a few taps. Of course, you will need to turn on a third-person view to see the changes. While in the form of a mob, you can gain some of its unique powers. Morph addon for Minecraft PE is an easy way to turn pranks on your friends.\r\n\u201cMutant Creatures\u201d - Mutant Creatures are basically improved versions of standard mobs, just more tough and dangerous. Some of them will have additional health or different appearance, but a few will get better abilities. For example, a skeleton will be able to shoot five arrows at once, and a creeper will cause a much bigger explosion. You can easily distinguish mutants from the regular mobs just by looking at them. Get a Mutant Creatures addon for Minecraft PE if you want to add a challenge to the base game.\r\n\u201cBen 10: The Protector of Earth\u201d - Ben 10: The Protector of Earth and his Omnitrix are now in Minecraft PE. Benjamin Tennyson a brave kid that received a device allowing him to transform into mighty aliens. Help Ben to recover a lost Omnitrix and fight along his side to save the Earth. Fight with the most prominent villains in the series - in the deadly boss fights.\r\n\u201cSiren Head\u201d - Siren Head addon adds a fictional creature into Minecraft PE that's supposed to scare you. The monster was created by an artist Trevor Henderson - it's a humanoid creature of abnormal size, that has two sirens on its head. Siren Head replays the records of a friend's voice to lure the victim. You'll be able to fight the Siren Head in MCPE using this addon.\r\n\u201cHorror Hospital map\u201d - You wake up in the hospital, but soon you've noticed that there is blood on the walls and no personnel. Firstly take the cam and use it in night vision mode - it's pretty dark out there and be ready to see scary things and even screamers. Batteries in the camera have limited time usage, so don't forget to change them from time to time and use them wisely. Find out more about the monster that is terrorizing the hospital and find a way to deal with it.\r\nAll of these scary mods for minecraft you will find in our application! You can play Minecraft PE on this map and this mods with your friends. We add: complex plot, incredibly completely new gameplay, new weapons and ores, maximum detail of the environment.\r\n\r\nIn our game you will find:\r\n\u25ba Powerful vampire, nocturnal creatures;\r\n\u25ba Huge and Small Spiders;\r\n\u25ba Insidious Skeletons;\r\n\u25ba Strong Zombies and other hostile mobs;\r\n\u25ba Realistic gameplay;\r\nThis is an unofficial application for Minecraft Pocket Edition. This application is not affiliated in any way with Mojang AB.\r\n\r\nGive your meaningful comment and rate us.\r\nThank you very much for your five star rating and review!\r\nContact :\t\t\r\nEmail - minecraftpemods.games@gmail.com",
